# 🌍 Applications

The original perceptron is simple, but the concepts behind it influenced many areas of AI.

Applications and related ideas include:

* Binary classification
* Pattern recognition
* Image classification
* Feature-based decision systems
* Neural network research
* Foundations of deep learning

Modern neural networks are far more powerful, but the perceptron remains an excellent starting point for understanding how artificial neurons learn.

