## 💡 Key Takeaway

A perceptron may look simple, but it introduced one of the most important ideas in machine learning:

**Learn the weights from data instead of manually defining every decision.**

Understanding the perceptron makes concepts such as **neurons, weights, bias, activation functions, decision boundaries, and neural network learning** much easier to understand.

---

## 🚀 Final Thought

> **Every complex neural network has simple ideas at its foundation. The perceptron is one of them.**

From a single artificial neuron to today's massive deep learning systems, the journey begins with understanding how a machine can turn **inputs into decisions and learn from its mistakes.**
